<title>USA: Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.42		    $1.24</p>
<p> Shr diluted     1.41		     1.23</p>
<p> Net		 239,000		  218,700</p>
<p> Oper Revs	 1,526,000		1,451,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary168,863		  176,507</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted169,218		  177,260</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call consensus estimate was $1.36.</p>
<p>	 Nine months</p>
<p> Shr primary		$4.21		    $3.87</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 4.21		     3.83</p>
<p> Net			723,600		  678,300</p>
<p> Oper Revs	    4,615,200		4,234,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     171,707		  175,174</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     171,865		  176,934</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 total revenues, including interest expense and provision for losses on receivables, were $2.22 billion vs $2.02 billion, and for the nine months $6.59 billion vs $5.81 billion.</p>
</text>
